+    *   **Eikonal Loss:** Regularize the network to output valid SDF:
+        $$ \mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{eik}} = \frac{1}{M} \sum_{i}^{M} (\|\nabla f(\mathbf{x}_i)\|_2 - 1)^2 $$
